@startuml
title 外部存储观测：现有边界内的候选模块
skinparam defaultFontName Hiragino Sans GB
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
rectangle "领域调用方\nFlowEngine / RunRegistry\nSession / Context / Memory" as Owners
package "Infrastructure Adapter 内部" {
  component "LogicalOperationRecorder\n固定操作描述器 / 有效增量" as Logical
  component "AdapterAttemptRecorder\n尝试字节 / 行数 / 耗时" as Attempt
  database "既有数据库 / Artifact 后端" as Store
  component "BackendStatsCollector\n能力 / 口径 / 新鲜度" as Collector
}
package "Operations 既有组件内部" {
  component "BoundedMetricAccumulator\n内存 Counter / Histogram" as Metrics
  component "TelemetryPipeline\n有界 Trace 队列 / Exporter" as Pipeline
  component "AmplificationWindowEvaluator\n匹配口径 / 比率 / unknown" as Window
}
cloud "外部推理服务\n仅输出其支持的 KV 指标" as Provider
rectangle "只读看板 / 告警" as View
Owners --> Logical : Repository / FlowJournal / Artifact Port
Logical --> Attempt : 原有调用与结果
Attempt --> Store : SQL / SDK
Logical ..> Metrics : U / S / logical duration
Attempt ..> Metrics : A / Rfetch / attempts
Collector ..> Store : 受限实例统计
Collector ..> Metrics : 可用的引擎与资源量
Provider ..> Metrics : provider metrics adapter
Metrics --> Window : 内存快照
Logical ..> Pipeline : 脱敏 Span
Window --> View : 比率 / 覆盖率 / 容量
Pipeline --> View : 采样 Trace
note bottom of View
只读输出，不反向推进领域状态。
设备成本按实际共享资源池统计。
安全审计沿用独立耐久路径。
end note
@enduml
